<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alumni Tracking System • Mezun ve Kariyer Platformu</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Plus Jakarta Sans for trendy, clean modern typography -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-base: #f8fafc;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --surface-subtle: #f1f5f9;
            --border-subtle: #e2e8f0;
            --border-hover: #cbd5e1;
            
            --text-heading: #0f172a;
            --text-body: #475569;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            
            --brand-primary: #4f46e5;
            --brand-hover: #4338ca;
            --brand-light: #eef2ff;
            
            --accent-users: #3b82f6;
            --accent-users-bg: #eff6ff;
            --accent-jobs: #10b981;
            --accent-jobs-bg: #ecfdf5;
            --accent-apps: #8b5cf6;
            --accent-apps-bg: #f5f3ff;
            --accent-announcements: #f59e0b;
            --accent-announcements-bg: #fffbeb;
            --accent-api: #06b6d4;
            --accent-api-bg: #ecfeff;
            
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
            --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.04);
            --shadow-card: 0 2px 8px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06), 0 1px 4px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
            --shadow-hover: 0 12px 24px -6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.09), 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
            
            --radius-md: 12px;
            --radius-lg: 16px;
            --radius-full: 9999px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-base);
            color: var(--text-body);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            position: relative;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        /* Ambient subtle light glow */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 1000px;
            height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.06), rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.03), transparent 70%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1120px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Modern Minimalist Navigation */
        nav.navbar {
            padding: 20px 0;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .nav-inner {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            padding: 10px 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 15px;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .brand-icon {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #6366f1);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-body);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--text-heading);
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
        }

        .nav-status {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #15803d;
            background: #f0fdf4;
            border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
        }

        .status-dot {
            width: 7px;
            height: 7px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #22c55e;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.25);
            animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-dot {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 0.7; }
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 60px 0 45px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .pill-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--brand-primary);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .pill-badge span.sparkle {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 52px);
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.035em;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 20%, #4f46e5 70%, #06b6d4 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero p.lead {
            font-size: 17px;
            color: var(--text-body);
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 0 auto 32px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            font-size: 14.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--brand-primary);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--brand-hover);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: var(--surface);
            color: var(--text-heading);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            border-color: var(--border-hover);
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Metric Highlights Ribbon */
        .metrics-strip {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 16px;
            margin: 30px 0 55px;
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 18px 20px;
            text-align: left;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .metric-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: var(--border-hover);
        }

        .metric-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .metric-value {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .metric-desc {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-body);
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        /* Section Title */
        .section-header {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .section-header p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Modules Grid */
        .modules-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .module-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 28px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .module-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            border-color: rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.25);
        }

        .card-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .icon-box {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .module-card:hover .icon-box {
            transform: scale(1.06);
        }

        .badge-tag {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        }

        .module-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-heading);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        .module-desc {
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: var(--text-body);
            line-height: 1.55;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .card-footer-action {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--brand-primary);
            transition: gap 0.2s ease;
        }

        .module-card:hover .card-footer-action {
            gap: 10px;
        }

        /* Color variants */
        .card-users .icon-box { background: var(--accent-users-bg); color: var(--accent-users); }
        .card-users .badge-tag { background: var(--accent-users-bg); color: var(--accent-users); }

        .card-jobs .icon-box { background: var(--accent-jobs-bg); color: var(--accent-jobs); }
        .card-jobs .badge-tag { background: var(--accent-jobs-bg); color: var(--accent-jobs); }

        .card-apps .icon-box { background: var(--accent-apps-bg); color: var(--accent-apps); }
        .card-apps .badge-tag { background: var(--accent-apps-bg); color: var(--accent-apps); }

        .card-announcements .icon-box { background: var(--accent-announcements-bg); color: var(--accent-announcements); }
        .card-announcements .badge-tag { background: var(--accent-announcements-bg); color: var(--accent-announcements); }

        .card-api .icon-box { background: var(--accent-api-bg); color: var(--accent-api); }
        .card-api .badge-tag { background: var(--accent-api-bg); color: var(--accent-api); }

        .card-wide {
            grid-column: span 2;
        }

        /* System Feature Banner */
        .system-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 32px 36px;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .banner-info h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .banner-info p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            max-width: 600px;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .banner-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .btn-banner {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-banner:hover {
            background: white;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            background: var(--surface);
            padding: 30px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .footer-inner {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: var(--text-body);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--brand-primary);
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .modules-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .card-wide {
                grid-column: span 2;
            }
            .metrics-strip {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .system-banner {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .modules-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .card-wide {
                grid-column: span 1;
            }
            .metrics-strip {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .nav-inner {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 12px;
                border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            }
            .nav-links {
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Minimalist Glass Navbar -->
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="nav-inner">
                <a href="/" class="brand">
                    <div class="brand-icon">🎓</div>
                    <span>Alumni<span style="color: var(--brand-primary);">.io</span></span>
                </a>
                
                <div class="nav-links">
                    <a href="/users" class="nav-link">👥 Mezunlar</a>
                    <a href="/jobs" class="nav-link">💼 İlanlar</a>
                    <a href="/applications" class="nav-link">📝 Başvurular</a>
                    <a href="/announcements" class="nav-link">📢 Duyurular</a>
                    <a href="/api/swagger" target="_blank" class="nav-link" style="color: #0d9488;">📖 API Docs</a>
                    <a href="/about" class="nav-link">ℹ️ Hakkında</a>
                </div>

                <div class="nav-status">
                    <span class="status-dot"></span>
                    <span>Sistem Çevrimiçi</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="container">
        
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="pill-badge">
                <span class="sparkle">✨</span>
                <span>Yeni Nesil Mezun Takip & Kariyer Ağı</span>
            </div>
            
            <h1>
                Mezuniyetten Kariyere,<br>
                <span class="gradient-text">Kesintisiz ve Güvenilir Bağlantı.</span>
            </h1>
            
            <p class="lead">
                Üniversite mezunları, yetenekli adaylar ve seçkin iş fırsatlarını buluşturan; 
                modern RESTful mimari ve gerçek zamanlı takip özelliklerine sahip kariyer platformu.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/jobs" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <span>💼 İş İlanlarını İncele</span>
                    <span>→</span>
                </a>
                <a href="/users" class="btn btn-secondary">
                    <span>👥 Mezun Ağını Keşfet</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Metric Highlights Strip -->
        <div class="metrics-strip">
            <div class="metric-card">
                <div class="metric-label">Mezun Portföyü</div>
                <div class="metric-value">Aktif Profil</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Kapsamlı mezun ve öğrenci veri tabanı</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card">
                <div class="metric-label">Kariyer Fırsatları</div>
                <div class="metric-value">Doğrulanmış</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Tam zamanlı, yarı zamanlı ve staj ilanları</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card">
                <div class="metric-label">Veri Mimarisi</div>
                <div class="metric-value">M:N İlişki</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">Başvuru junction tablosu ile uçtan uca bağ</div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card">
                <div class="metric-label">Altyapı Güvenliği</div>
                <div class="metric-value">Guardian 🛡️</div>
                <div class="metric-desc">404/5xx koruması & merkezi hata loglama</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section Heading -->
        <div class="section-header">
            <div>
                <h2>Platform Modülleri</h2>
                <p>İhtiyacınız olan modüle tek tıkla erişin ve işlemlerinizi gerçekleştirin.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Modern Cards Grid -->
        <div class="modules-grid">
            
            <!-- Users Card -->
            <a href="/users" class="module-card card-users">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-top">
                        <div class="icon-box">👥</div>
                        <span class="badge-tag">PROFİLLER</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-title">Mezun & Öğrenci Yönetimi</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">
                        Mezun profillerini listeleyin, detaylarını inceleyin, yeni mezun kaydı oluşturun ve kariyer geçmişlerini güncelleyin.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer-action">
                    <span>Profilleri Yönet</span>
                    <span>→</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Jobs Card -->
            <a href="/jobs" class="module-card card-jobs">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-top">
                        <div class="icon-box">💼</div>
                        <span class="badge-tag">KARİYER</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-title">İş & Staj İlanları</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">
                        Açık pozisyonları filtreleyin, şirket detaylarını görüntüleyin, yeni iş fırsatları oluşturun ve başvuranları takip edin.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer-action">
                    <span>İlanları Keşfet</span>
                    <span>→</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Applications Card -->
            <a href="/applications" class="module-card card-apps">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-top">
                        <div class="icon-box">📝</div>
                        <span class="badge-tag">SÜREÇLER</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-title">Başvuru Takibi</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">
                        Adayların ilanlara yaptığı başvuruları, değerlendirme aşamalarını ve ön yazı detaylarını merkezi olarak yönetin.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer-action">
                    <span>Başvuruları İncele</span>
                    <span>→</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Announcements Card -->
            <a href="/announcements" class="module-card card-announcements">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-top">
                        <div class="icon-box">📢</div>
                        <span class="badge-tag">BİLDİRİMLER</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-title">Duyurular & Etkinlikler</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">
                        Üniversite duyuruları, kariyer günleri, seminerler ve mezunlar buluşması etkinliklerini güncel olarak paylaşın.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer-action">
                    <span>Duyuruları Oku</span>
                    <span>→</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- REST API Card (Wide) -->
            <a href="/api/swagger" target="_blank" class="module-card card-api card-wide">
                <div>
                    <div class="card-top">
                        <div class="icon-box">⚡</div>
                        <span class="badge-tag">REST API v1</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="module-title">Swagger UI & OpenAPI Dokümantasyonu</div>
                    <div class="module-desc">
                        Tüm Users, Jobs, Applications ve Announcements CRUD uç noktalarını Swagger arayüzü ile interaktif olarak test edin ve entegre olun.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer-action">
                    <span>API Konsolunu Aç</span>
                    <span>↗</span>
                </div>
            </a>

        </div>

        <!-- Guardian & System Architecture Banner -->
        <div class="system-banner">
            <div class="banner-info">
                <h3>🛡️ Kurumsal Standartlarda Guardian Mimarisi</h3>
                <p>
                    Logger Middleware ile anlık istek analizi, 404 Guardian ile zarif yönlendirme, 
